@startuml wt_mixed_digging_failover
title WT failover across DIGGING entry
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 75
participant "Initialized Boomlet A" as A
participant "Lagging Boomlet B" as B
participant "Other three Boomlets" as P
participant "Candidate WT" as C
participant "Bound SARs" as S

note over A,B
  A has initialized its mystery.
  B has accepted the same approvals and produced its exact commit,
  but has not accepted the complete commit collection.
end note

ref over A,C
  02_common_switch.puml
  Five reviewed frozen manifests select PRESERVE_WITHDRAWAL.
  Candidate validates committed reconstruction and original gates.
  Every peer verifies its exact outstanding SAR acknowledgment before PREPARE.
end ref

alt Final ABORT
  A -> A: Retain initialized delay and pending obligations
  B -> B: Retain local commit and original phase
else Final ACTIVATE
  A -> A: Install head; retain mystery, counter, IDs, block heights and sequences
  B -> B: Install head; retain accepted approvals and own exact commit
  C -> C: Reconstruct five exact signed padded commits
  C -> B: Complete COMMIT_SET, own SAR acknowledgment,\nand fresh head-scoped WT commit response
  B -> B: Verify own prior gates, all five commits, exact acknowledgment,\nIDs, activation certificate, chain and milestone conditions;\nonly exact historical commit and gate ages receive an exception
  alt Every local DIGGING entry guard holds
    B -> B: Sample mystery once; initialize counter, block height and sequence
    A -> A: Retain discharge and completed pre-freeze challenge
    A -> C: Fresh recovery ping with retained reached state
    B -> C: Normal initial ping for the preserved approved withdrawal
    P -> P: Each peer retains its verified frozen discharge
    P -> C: Initial or recovery pings according to each peer's state
    ref over A,S
      06_digging_failover.puml
      Continue from the current-ping collection into ordinary pong validation.
    end ref
  else Missing evidence or invalid local prerequisite
    B -> B: Stall entry while retaining its current state
  end
end
@enduml
